SUMMARY:Social & Tom East Side Trail & Glen Cross Side Trail
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\n**Meetup Location:** Location
 : Hockley Valley PNR/ Bruce Trail Free Parking across from the Black Birch
  Restaurant (307388 Hockley Rd\, Mono\, ON L9W 2Y8)\nJoin us for a scenic 
 and challenging hike through the beautiful Tom East Side Trail and Glen Cr
 0ss Side Trail. This route offers a great mix of of forest trails\, rollin
 g hills\, and rewarding views\, making it a perfect choice for those looki
 ng for a solid day on the trails.\nHike Details:\nDuration: Approx. 4 hour
 s with breaks.\nDifficulty: Moderate to Challengin\nPace: Moderate\n**Plea
 se come prepared**\n1\\. Bring plenty of water\n2\\. Bug spray is highly r
 ecommended\n3\\. Bring snacks and light lunch\n4\\. Wear appropriate cloth
 ing\nAfter the hike\, anyone interested is welcome to join us at the Black
  Birch Restaurant to unwind\, refuel and get to know each other!\nSee you 
 on the Trail!
