SUMMARY:Best Trail Ever! Seaton Trail
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\nStart Time: 10:00am\n**MeetUp
  Location: Main Parking Lot seaton Trail...take 401 east to Brock Rd in pi
 ckering\, head north to 3rd consession abd turn left. Proceed to Whitevale
  Rd and head into the village. The parking lit is off Whitevale Rd**\n\nJo
 in us for a 15.3 km trail hike with 190 m elevation gain. This is a popula
 r and beautiful trail and very rewarding. The trail isnt always well maint
 ained but hey\, thats half the fun! You might run into brush\, missing sta
 irs or fallen trees but I say bring it on!\nBring lors of water\, deet\, a
 nd lunch with snacks!
